<hr><font color="#FFFFFF"><font size=+2>The ISFDB
</font><font size=+0>is
an effort to catalog works of Science Fiction, Fantasy, and Horror. It
links together various types of bibliographic data: author bibliographies,
publication bibliographies, award listings, magazine content listings,
anthology and collection content listings, yearly fiction indexes, and
forthcoming books.</font></font>
